RTGT-1#1 Advisory
RAM retargeting possibility  
Identified 6 RAM64X1D primitives that could be retargeted to RAM64M. Retargeting will save approximately 4 memory LUTs and improve routability. These can usually be achieved using synthesis inference or XPMs. The memories are u_soc/u_qspi/rx_fifo_reg_0_63_0_0, u_soc/u_qspi/rx_fifo_reg_0_63_1_1,
u_soc/u_qspi/rx_fifo_reg_0_63_2_2, u_soc/u_qspi/rx_fifo_reg_0_63_3_3,
u_soc/u_qspi/rx_fifo_reg_0_63_4_4, u_soc/u_qspi/rx_fifo_reg_0_63_5_5
Related violations: <none>

